@startuml US_3_1_4_C4_Processos
title US 3.1.4 - Processo de feedback detalhado

actor User
participant Form as "Form Component"
participant Service as "Service"
participant API as "TodoApi"
participant Toast as "ToastService"

User -> Form: submit
Form -> Form: show loading
Form -> Service: call API
Service -> API: HTTP request
alt sucesso
  API --> Service: 2xx
  Service --> Form: ok
  Form -> Toast: success(...)
  Form -> Form: reset loading; refresh list
else erro
  API --> Service: 4xx/5xx + mensagens
  Service --> Form: error detail
  Form -> Form: map errors to inputs
  Form -> Toast: error(friendly message)
  Form -> Form: reset loading
end

@enduml
